{"ticker":"BKNG","updated":"2026-11-13T22:41:53Z","profile":{"longName":"Booking Holdings Inc.","shortName":"Booking Holdings Inc. Common St","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Travel Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.bookingholdings.com","fullTimeEmployees":25850,"marketCap":118679846912,"trailingPE":17.308025,"forwardPE":13.019457,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.219578,"pegRatio":0.59,"targetMeanPrice":215.65714,"targetHighPrice":267.0,"targetLowPrice":150.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":35,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.013,"earningsGrowth":0.068,"grossMargins":0.87179,"operatingMargins":0.32845002,"profitMargins":0.25521,"totalRevenue":28125999104,"beta":1.153,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":220.806,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":146.28,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.04},"summary":"Booking Holdings Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides online and traditional travel and restaurant reservations and related services in the United States, the Netherlands, the United Kingdom, and internationally. The company operates Booking.com, which offers online accommodation reservations; and Priceline, which provides discount travel reservations services, as well as online accommodation, flight, rental car reservation services, vacation packages, cruises, activity, and affiliate programs. It also operates Agoda that offers online accommodation reservation, flight, ground transportation, and attractions. In addition, the company operates KAYAK, an online meta-search service that allows consumers to search and compare travel itineraries and prices; and OpenTable for booking online restaurant reservations, as well as reservation management services to restaurants. Further, it offers travel-related insurance products, payment facilitation, and restaurant management services to consumers, travel service providers, and restaurants; and advertising services. The company was formerly known as The Priceline Group Inc. and changed its name to Booking Holdings Inc. in February 2018. Booking Holdings Inc. was founded in 1997 and is headquartered in Norwalk, Connecticut.","summary_zh":"Booking Holdings Inc. 及其子公司在美國、荷蘭、英國和國際上提供線上和傳統旅遊及餐廳預訂及相關服務。該公司經營 Booking.com，提供線上住宿預訂服務； Priceline，提供折扣旅遊預訂服務，以及線上住宿、航班、租車預訂服務、度假套餐、遊輪、活動和聯營計劃。它還運營 Agoda，提供線上住宿預訂、航班、地面交通和景點服務。此外，該公司還經營KAYAK，這是一種線上元搜尋服務，可讓消費者搜尋和比較旅遊行程和價格； OpenTable用於線上餐廳預訂，以及餐廳預訂管理服務。此外，它還向消費者、旅遊服務提供者和餐廳提供與旅遊相關的保險產品、支付便利性和餐廳管理服務；和廣告服務。該公司前身為 The Priceline Group Inc.，於 2018 年 2 月更名為 Booking Holdings Inc.。 Booking Holdings Inc. 成立於 1997 年，總部位於康乃狄克州諾沃克。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"旅遊服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":220.0,"h":222.4,"l":216.96,"c":222.3932,"v":4127500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":223.0632,"h":223.0632,"l":217.202,"c":219.0004,"v":4307500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":219.7536,"h":222.296,"l":218.1984,"c":222.148,"v":5287500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":222.28,"h":223.51,"l":216.4316,"c":217.7152,"v":5870000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":217.9184,"h":218.6264,"l":216.0,"c":217.7776,"v":10512500},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":216.0,"h":219.094,"l":214.8,"c":218.2852,"v":5360000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":217.0,"h":220.7032,"l":216.9564,"c":220.3608,"v":4477500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":221.1228,"h":221.1228,"l":217.14,"c":221.024,"v":3805000},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":220.9196,"h":223.2876,"l":218.16,"c":223.0292,"v":6130000},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":223.138,"h":223.4648,"l":219.2776,"c":221.92,"v":4057500},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":222.8664,"h":223.442,"l":217.9212,"c":218.1924,"v":5932500},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":217.08,"h":218.3244,"l":214.0376,"c":215.9708,"v":4937500},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":214.08,"h":215.0092,"l":210.0,"c":214.0224,"v":8105000},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":213.0156,"h":217.2384,"l":212.04,"c":216.982,"v":5212500},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":217.9788,"h":218.6328,"l":214.8052,"c":216.722,"v":6740000},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":214.7216,"h":224.9956,"l":210.4032,"c":216.7948,"v":8847500},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":216.8888,"h":216.8888,"l":207.52,"c":209.68,"v":6615000},